<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-AUSTRIAN OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRIAN OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LINZ, Austria 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results from the</p>
<p>Austrian Open women's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Sandrine Testud (France) beat Patricia Hy-Boulais (Canada) 4-6</p>
<p>6-0 6-3</p>
<p>Barbara Rittner (Germany) beat Elena Wagner (Germany) 7-5 5-0</p>
<p>(retired)</p>
<p>5-Magdalena Maleva (Bulgaria) beat Anne Miller (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-3 2-6 6-2</p>
<p>4-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Karin Kschwendt</p>
<p>(Austria) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Els Callens (Belgium) beat Rita Grande (Italy) 4-6 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>6-Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat Gloria Pizzichini (Italy) 6-4</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>8-Asa Carlsson (Sweden) beat Florencia Labat (Argentina) 6-0</p>
<p>7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Andrea Glass (Germany) beat Melanie Schnell (Austria) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Flora Perfetti (Italy) beat Petra Begerow (Germany) 6-3 6-1</p>
</text>
